        "question_id": "q-167216",
        "problem": "In terms of $a$ and $b,\\,p(15)=\\,$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        .",
        "status": "ambiguous",
